  "instructions": [
    "In a pan over medium heat, melt the butter and add the minced garlic.",
    "Add the flour to the pan and stir for 1 minute, creating a light roux.",
    "Add the coconut milk, salt, black pepper, allspice, nutmeg, thyme, and pimento berries to the pan, whisking to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes, allowing it to thicken.",
    "Stir in the chopped cilantro, if using.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning, as needed.",
    "Serve the Jamaican garlic quick-fix hot or at room temperature.",
    "Garnish with sliced lime wedges, if desired."
  ],
